

# header ends at column 50 ----------------------|
# Header: imperative, sentence case, no trailing period, 50 chars max.
#   Example: Add a pick-up day picker to checkout
# Never put an issue or PR number in the header.
#
# Then one blank line, then a one-sentence summary of the commit.
#
# Then one blank line, then the rest of the commit, written in Markdown.
# Wrap the body at 72 characters. Only URLs may run longer.
# body wraps at column 72 ---------------------------------------------|
#
# Images go in a one-column table, the image in the header cell and the
# caption in the one row:
#
# | ![Alt text](image-url) |
# |:---:|
# | Caption |
#
# Lines starting with "#" are removed when you commit. For a heading,
# underline it with "=" or "-" instead.
